{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a1534b-d6c4-7387-8ad3-24c6813c45d3","toolName":"task","args":{},"result":"{\"lg_name\":\"Command\",\"update\":{\"files\":{},\"messages\":[{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain_core\",\"messages\",\"ToolMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":\"## Source\\n/home/user/app/contracts/DemandPool.sol  \\n/home/user/app/contracts/Settler.sol\\n\\n## Action\\nextended\\n\\n## Survey\\n- `survey_solidity_contracts` candidates:\\n  - `contracts/DealFactory.sol` (declares `DealFactory`)\\n  - `contracts/DemandPool.sol` (declares `DemandPool`)\\n  - `contracts/Settler.sol` (declares `Settler`)\\n  - `contracts/SwarmTypes.sol` (declares `SwarmTypes`)\\n- `survey_solidity_contracts` hidden: none (`hiddenCount = 0`)\\n- Worked on:\\n  - `/home/user/app/contracts/DemandPool.sol`\\n  - `/home/user/app/contracts/Settler.sol`\\n\\n## Summary\\n- Applied the collateral redesign in `DemandPool`: removed per-buyer escrow (`_escrowed`) and `livePricePaid`, added `mapping(uint256 => uint64) public collateral`, initialized it from `deal.tiers[0].pricePerUnit` in `commit()` on first commit, and now always `transferFrom` that uniform collateral amount.\\n- Updated `DemandPool.commit()` and `DemandPool.withdraw()` to emit `TierBroken` on **any** clearing price change (`priceAfter != priceBefore`), and ensured `Committed`/`Withdrawn` `livePrice` field carries `priceAfter`.\\n- Converted `DemandPool.withdraw()` to pull-payment flow: removed direct `USDC.transfer`, added inline `ISettler` interface, and now calls `ISettler(settler).creditWithdrawal(msg.sender, collateral[dealId])`.\\n- Kept `pullForSettler` restricted to `msg.sender == settler` and `nonReentrant`; kept `withdraw()` deadline guard as `block.timestamp >= deal.deadline => revert DeadlinePassed()`.\\n- Added `Settler.creditWithdrawal(address,uint256)` restricted to `msg.sender == address(pool)`; credits `claimable` only (no token transfer, no pause check, no reentrancy guard).\\n- Updated `Settler.settle()` to remove per-buyer escrow reads and use uniform collateral model:\\n  - `cp = pool.clearingPrice(dealId)`, `top = pool.collateral(dealId)`\\n  - buyer refund per buyer = `top - cp`\\n  - supplier credit = `cp * buyerCount`\\n  - replaced bare `assert` with named error `ConservationViolation()` via explicit check:\\n    `if (totalEscrowed != supplierCredit + totalRefunds) revert ConservationViolation();`\\n- Updated `Settler.refundAll()` to refund each buyer using `pool.collateral(dealId)` (uniform collateral), removing per-buyer escrow lookups.\\n- Left `DealFactory.sol` unchanged; confirmed existing per-tier `PriceCapExceeded()` checks still enforce the 5 USDC cap on `tiers[0].pricePerUnit` as required.\\n- Left `SwarmTypes.sol` unchanged; `claimable` in `Settler` remains `mapping(address => uint256)` and `claim()` still zeroes then pulls through `pool.pullForSettler`.\",\"tool_call_id\":\"toolu_bdrk_01V7oqQFzCzpKHwGGUvmZZzL\",\"name\":\"task\",\"additional_kwargs\":{},\"response_metadata\":{}}}]},\"goto\":[]}"}}
