{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"file_write_streaming","toolCallId":"01a15351-295c-740f-898e-e99917e6baba","path":"/home/user/app/AGENTS.md","status":"running","chunk":"## What This App Does\n\n**Swarm** — pooled demand with volume-tiered pricing on Arc Testnet. Buyers commit USDC collateral to a deal; as more buyers join, the live clearing price drops. At deadline, everyone settles at one uniform clearing price (refund = collateral - clearing). If minimum buyers aren't met, everyone is refunded in full. Pull-payment model: all credits accumulate in a claimable mapping; a single claim() call pays out across all deals.","oldContent":"## What This App Does\n\n[Brief description of what the app does and its primary use case]","totalLines":3,"oldTotalLines":3}}
