{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"file_write_streaming","toolCallId":"01a15351-64ba-779c-bb65-b1b7d8058616","path":"/home/user/app/AGENTS.md","status":"running","chunk":"## To Run\n\n```bash\nbun install\nbun run dev\n```\n\n---\n\n## Deployed Contracts (Arc Testnet, Chain ID 5042002)\n\n| Contract | Address | Deploy Block | Explorer |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| DealFactory | `0x6467ba3447a30b8ff6ad237ec334b554cf82e4f9` | 67983356 | [link](https://explorer.testnet.arc.io/address/0x6467ba3447a30b8ff6ad237ec334b554cf82e4f9) |\n| DemandPool  | `0xd9703a5d11de5c1ace35e3bb8e176fea980d3a48` | 67983377 | [link](https://explorer.testnet.arc.io/address/0xd9703a5d11de5c1ace35e3bb8e176fea980d3a48) |\n| Settler     | `0x7069f5aef3ec8e3b138cc0381457b846a982d81d` | 67983398 | [link](https://explorer.testnet.arc.io/address/0x7069f5aef3ec8e3b138cc0381457b846a982d81d) |\n\n### Post-deploy wiring (one-time, owner must call)\nAfter deploy, the owner wallet (`0x5B12Ce46C7194aD57d143bC22847224047b1Ef42`) must call:\n1. `DemandPool.setSettler(0x7069f5aef3ec8e3b138cc0381457b846a982d81d)` — wires Settler into DemandPool for pull-payment credits\n2. `DealFactory.setSettler(0x7069f5aef3ec8e3b138cc0381457b846a982d81d)` — authorises Settler to call setDealState\n3. `DealFactory.setDemandPool(0xd9703a5d11de5c1ace35e3bb8e176fea980d3a48)` — (informational; DemandPool address stored in factory for reference)\n\n### USDC (ERC-20)\nAddress: `0x3600000000000000000000000000000000000000` (6 decimals, Arc Testnet native token)","oldContent":"## To Run\n\n```bash\nbun install\nbun run dev\n```","totalLines":25,"oldTotalLines":6}}
